  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your aqueous powers create a bridge into and through the verges of the Plane of Water.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Triton Portal<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may expend your hydraulic push ability to cast lesser planar ally to call an ally with the aquatic or water subtype, or to create an effect like dimension door, save that you can only use this ability when immersed in water and the destination point must also be immersed in water. You need not arrive on a stable surface when using this ability.</p>\n<p>If you are at least 6th tier, you can expend two uses of mythic power to create an effect that duplicates shadow walk, but rather than passing through the Shadow Plane you pass through swift currents within the Plane of Water. This journey takes place completely underwater. If you bring companions that are unable to breathe water, you may expend one additional use of mythic power for each companion to allow them to breathe water for the duration of this underwater shadow walk.</p>\n<p>You can use this ability more than once per day by expending one use of mythic power for each use after the first.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-t-z-feats#toc16\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
